  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Umbrella Facility for Gender Equality (UFGE)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The broad objective of this facility is to strengthen awareness, knowledge, and capacity for gender-informed policy making and programs. It will finance initiatives with a strong &#x2018;public goods&#x2019; rationale, including frontier areas of knowledge, knowledge management, and improving the availability and quality of gender-related statistics.</narrative>
  </description>
